# Hourly probe of the Air's vault (starts voice-lab-vault-air.service). Most runs do nothing:
# the copy is younger than a week, or the Air is asleep or away. The first run after the Air
# wakes with a copy a week old pushes it, wherever the Air is. Persistent= runs a missed
# hour once the PC is back. Installed by hand with its service (deploy/host-manual/README.md).
[Unit]
Description=voice-lab vault copy to the MacBook Air, probed hourly

[Timer]
OnCalendar=hourly
RandomizedDelaySec=10min
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
